    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d639">

                <pb facs="0771" n="669" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg669"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 847/144.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister for Foreign Affairs of
                            Panama to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-10-06"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 6,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>President Obaldia requests me to convey to you the expressions of his
                    appreciation of your kind congratulations, and I beg that you will accept my own
                    for your benevolent phrases concerning myself. I feel confident that our always
                    pleasant and cordial relations will be continued and aid much toward a
                    satisfactory solution of the affairs between our respective Governments.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Arango.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
